{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id682528272"}, "name":{"label":"kvicidusydycufudu"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-10-13T20:29:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"9182198659"}, "title":{"label":"WOW"}, "content":{"label":"this is exactly what I needed! I just wish I could get the premium version because i have multiple apps that i want to block. It’s such an amazing idea and i’ve tried lots of apps like this and one sec is my favourite!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1080699412"}, "name":{"label":"lydia 🧚‍♀️"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-09-14T14:29:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"9085170049"}, "title":{"label":"look at the “edit”"}, "content":{"label":"so i was really excited about this app because i really need help to manage my time on social media but apples screen time doesn’t really help me. however they only allow you to “block” ONE app yea that’s right ONE! i just spent so long setting up many different apps only for them to not work. (not to mention i also tried to set up other things too.) i was disappointed but thought maybe i could buy the pro version? nope it’s expensive. this app was meant to help people but wants you the pay? kinda counter intuitive if you ask me. anyway this app seems great if you’re willing to pay but coming from a broke and i mean BROKE student….i can’t afford this app. i’m disappointed and wish it was free.\n\nEDIT: \nI reached out to the developer like he said I should, and he indeed gave me a promo code, and now that I have used this app with the pro version 10/10 I would recommend it! It’s great! It has helped me reduce my screen time already and it’s amazing how he’s able to help the people who cannot afford it! Go install this app!!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id120440801"}, "name":{"label":"Typewritter asks"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-09-13T14:32:29-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"9081942964"}, "title":{"label":"Great concept"}, "content":{"label":"Love that this app makes you think about what you are doing and makes you reconsider how you spend your time. I set this app up for a few of my social media accounts but realized you have to pay for it to work on more than 1 app. Unfortunately I cannot afford the app at this time as I am a student. Thought this would help me, especially around exam time as I find myself procrastinating but now I can’t see myself using it for only one app. Overall good idea though.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1354353580"}, "name":{"label":"MoonlightRo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-07-14T08:06:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.4"}, "id":{"label":"8873455130"}, "title":{"label":"Great, just one thing…"}, "content":{"label":"It was a lot better than what I was expecting except i really dont want to pay for doing most things on the app. Really great though!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id138479215"}, "name":{"label":"stejlay"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-05-16T05:22:20-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"8676719370"}, "title":{"label":"☹️"}, "content":{"label":"I liked the idea of this app, but there seems to be some kind of glitch. When set up as directed, it does, indeed, prompt you to take a deep breath when you open a social media app, then asks whether you wish to continue to social media. Unfortunately, upon selecting “Continue”, the social media app opens … only to immediately shunt you back to “one sec”, a cycle which continues indefinitely. “one sec” includes an option which would likely address the issue (permitting app-switching within 1 minute, 3 minutes, etc. without triggering the ‘deep breath’ prompt), but the monthly price is far too steep. Thus the app proved unusable. A shame. I’ll continue searching for alternatives.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id322613789"}, "name":{"label":"Connor McBrine-Ellis"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-05-13T10:39:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"8667332396"}, "title":{"label":"Ridiculous price"}, "content":{"label":"The app is super cool but I couldn’t believe the kind of subscription pricing the developer is asking. It’s ridiculous to imply that this app is worth that much money as a subscription. \n\nI love paying for software but there’s no way I would pay much more than a couple bucks. This should be a one time purchase too and not a subscription.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
