{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id488269752"}, "name":{"label":"Mrflowsterinoooo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-01-13T11:33:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.1"}, "id":{"label":"6865930613"}, "title":{"label":"Perfect solution!"}, "content":{"label":"Works a lot better than setting up screen times in your iPhone settings. The deep breath and countdown truly allows you to think about why you’re opening the app, and prevents mindless scrolling. I’ve recommended this app to everyone I know, especially those who resort to deleting social media when it takes up too much time. This is a much more efficient solution. Thank you!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
